{"title":"빙공의 대가","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cnVj9/hAJmBGUmn9/JjAjXXTMrQwHX2xZBUG2w1&filename=th3","synopsis":"“힘과 권력, 세상은 그게 전부다”\n\n구걸이나 하는 밑바닥 인생, 동아패의 고아 운비.\n\n힘이 없다는 이유만으로 세상에서 가장 약자인 그는\n이 빌어먹을 운명을 벗어나기 위해 환관의 길을 택한다.\n\n운비는 극음극한의 절세무공인 백일홍의 씨앗을 받고\n황제의 계략인 [대무림말살계획]의 일환으로 \n황궁 특수부대 나찰귀로에 속하게 되는데...\n\n바야흐로 대 격변의 시대, 끊임없는 암투 속 치열한 수 싸움에서\n극악의 영악함과 잔인함으로 점철된 인물, 빙공의 대가 '운비'의 종횡무진 무협 일대기!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":139,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":165,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":138,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":152,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":266,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":159,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":238,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":165,"change":{"type":"up","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":144,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":152,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":139,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":135,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":129,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":225,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date"